OL,3,CUK Government urged to copy SNP
OL,4,Csupport worth thousands for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FLabour should follow the SNP's lead by
OL,8,Fmatching cost-of-living support for
OL,9,Fyoung people, an MP has urged.
OL,11,FSNP MP Lara Bird said young people in
OL,12,FScotland were saving thousands of
OL,13,Fpounds compared with their
OL,14,Fcounterparts in England.
OL,16,FShe said this included free university
OL,17,Ftuition, free bus travel for under-22s
OL,18,Fand the education maintenance
OL,19,Fallowance (EMA).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
