OL,3,CUK Government urged to copy SNP
OL,4,Csupport worth thousands for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FThe #30-a-week benefit is paid out to
OL,8,Flow-income teenagers between 16 and 19
OL,9,Fwho stay in school or further
OL,10,Feducation.
OL,12,FAccording to new analysis by the House
OL,13,Fof Commons Library, eligible students
OL,14,Fare receiving up to #1,140 a year
OL,15,Fthrough the scheme, with more than
OL,16,F21,000 young people receiving a
OL,17,Fpayment in 2024/25.
OL,19,FThe analysis shows students south of
OL,20,Fthe border lost out on an estimated
OL,21,F#775 million over the last year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
