OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786324674
OL,3,CUK Government urged to copy SNP
OL,4,Csupport worth thousands for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FThe EMA in England was scrapped in
OL,8,F2014, saving the Treasury around #8
OL,9,Fbillion since.
OL,11,FThe SNP has claimed the Scottish
OL,12,FGovernment would receive up to an
OL,13,Fextra #90 million a year in extra
OL,14,Ffunding if the UK Government decided
OL,15,Fto reinstate the scheme.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
