OL,3,CUK Government urged to copy SNP
OL,4,Csupport worth thousands for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FMs Bird said: "Under the SNP, young
OL,8,Fpeople in Scotland are benefiting from
OL,9,Fthe best cost-of-living support in the
OL,10,FUK ` and they are saving thousands of
OL,11,Fpounds compared to the extra costs the
OL,12,FLabour Government is piling on to
OL,13,Fyoung people in England.
OL,15,F"In Scotland, the SNP scrapped tuition
OL,16,Ffees and as a result young people
OL,17,Fstart their working lives with around
OL,18,F#35,000 less debt than students in
OL,19,FEngland."
OL,26,@oD@OOUwD@AOU{D@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
