OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786324674
OL,3,CUK Government urged to copy SNP
OL,4,Csupport worth thousands for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,FShe said this came as tuition fees are
OL,8,Fset to increase for the second time
OL,9,Fsince 2024 to #9,790 a year from
OL,10,FSeptember.
OL,12,FMs Bird added: "While young people in
OL,13,FScotland are benefiting from up to
OL,14,F#1,140 a year in education maintenance
OL,15,Fallowance grants, to help them stay in
OL,16,Feducation, the Labour Party's refusal
OL,17,Fto reinstate the EMA means that young
OL,18,Fpeople in England will lose out on an
OL,19,Festimated #775 million of support this
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,26,@tD@POU
