OL,3,CUK Government urged to copy SNP
OL,4,Csupport worth thousands for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"Andy Burnham must follow Scotland's
OL,8,Flead by matching the SNP government's
OL,9,Fcost-of-living support for young
OL,10,Fpeople ` including in areas like free
OL,11,Fbus travel for under-22s, where many
OL,12,Fyoung people in Scotland are saving
OL,13,Fover #1,000 a year compared to young
OL,14,Fpeople in England.
OL,16,F"Doing so would deliver more funding
OL,17,Fright across the UK, meaning the
OL,18,FScottish Government would have more
OL,19,Fmoney to deliver more cost-of-living
OL,20,Fsupport for families and young people
OL,21,Fin Scotland too.
OL,26,@oD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
