OL,3,CUK Government urged to copy SNP
OL,4,Csupport worth thousands for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"The fact that Scotland has chosen a
OL,8,Fdifferent path, with more support for
OL,9,Ffamilies, shows the difference we
OL,10,Fcould make with the full powers of
OL,11,Findependence."
OL,13,FA UK Government spokesperson said:
OL,14,F"The UK Government is determined to
OL,15,Fprovide breathing space on the cost of
OL,16,Fliving.
