OL,3,CUK Government urged to copy SNP
OL,4,Csupport worth thousands for young
OL,5,Cpeople
OL,7,F"In his first weeks in office, the
OL,8,FPrime Minister has taken immediate
OL,9,Faction to put more money in people's
OL,10,Fpockets, including by cutting VAT from
OL,11,Felectricity bills and capping bus
OL,12,Ffares in England and Wales."
